Whoa, I can't hear anything! Um...

371
00:18:05,931 --> 00:18:08,931
うわ、新モジュール来てる！
Whoa, a new module is here!

372
00:18:08,931 --> 00:18:12,931
一旦、右下のレバー、レバー行っとこか、レバー
For now, the lever on the bottom right... Let's do the lever. Lever.

373
00:18:12,931 --> 00:18:15,931
はい、レバー。オッケー、レバー。オッケー、レバー
Yes, lever. Okay, lever. Okay, lever.

374
00:18:15,931 --> 00:18:19,931
