Okay, going for levers. There are four levers.

375
00:18:19,931 --> 00:18:20,931
はい
Yes.

376
00:18:20,931 --> 00:18:23,931
で、左からレッド、ブルー、グリーン、イエロー
And from the left: red, blue, green, yellow.

377
00:18:23,931 --> 00:18:26,231
レッド、ブルー、グリーン...あれ？
Red, blue, green... Huh?

378
00:18:26,931 --> 00:18:28,431
え、何も押してないよ、今
Huh? I didn't press anything just now.

379
