I think it tells you which button to press.

517
00:23:14,639 --> 00:23:15,639
そうだね。
Yeah.

518
00:23:15,839 --> 00:23:19,839
あーはいはいはい、はいはいはい。
Ah, right, right, right, right, right.

519
00:23:20,039 --> 00:23:21,539
